    "supportAdmin": "Support Admin",
    "faqTitle": "FAQs",
    "faq1Question": "How do I post a product?",
    "faq1Answer": "Tap 'Post Listing' on your dashboard. Enter crop details and location.",
    "faq2Question": "How do buyers contact me?",
    "faq2Answer": "Buyers message or call you directly from your listing.",
    "faq3Question": "How is market price calculated?",
    "faq3Answer": "We track wholesale indices across major hubs like Addis Ababa and Adama.",
    "faq4Question": "How do I change my language?",
    "faq4Answer": "Go to Profile and select Language / ቋንቋ.",
    "faq5Question": "Is my phone number safe?",
    "faq5Answer": "It is protected and shared only for transactions.",
    "faq6Question": "What is a Quintal?",
    "faq6Answer": "One quintal (q) is 100 kg. It's the standard wholesale unit.",
    "faq7Question": "How do I update order status?",
    "faq7Answer": "Open the order and update status to Confirmed, In Transit, or Delivered.",
    "faq8Question": "I need support.",
    "faq8Answer": "Call our support team directly at 0938730818.",
    "faq9Question": "Does the Farmers' Union control who joins?",
    "faq9Answer": "Yes. Every new account must be approved by the Farmers' Union or an admin before it can post products, place orders, or send messages. You can register at any time, but your account won't be fully active until it's verified.",
    "faq10Question": "Is there a fee to use OmishGo?",
    "faq10Answer": "No. OmishGo is free to use during the pilot period. There are no fees for posting products or placing orders.",
    "faq11Question": "Do I need internet the whole time?",
    "faq11Answer": "Not always. If you lose connection while posting a product, it saves as a draft on your phone and syncs automatically once you're back online.",
    "aboutTitle": "About OmishGo",
    "aboutText": "OmishGo connects farmers directly with buyers so more of the sale price stays with the farmer. The Farmers' Union approves every account to keep the platform trustworthy.",
